cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MARS, please cite it as below."
title: "MARS — Mesh Adaptive Refinement for Supercomputing"
abstract: >-
  MARS is an open-source, GPU-native mesh and assembly library for finite-element codes on
  3D tetrahedral and hexahedral meshes, written in C++20 for CUDA, HIP and MPI.
type: software
